        "You ride the grass for three days with the bundle in your coat. At each camp you give a cloth and are given tea. The clans take the cloths and read the knots with their thumbs. They ask about the girl. They say the girl’s father is a hard man. They say nobody has crossed him in twenty years, and nobody ever means to.",
